f:["$","p","p-6",{"children":"Rust 为了在提供高性能的同时保证内存安全和线程安全，花了大量力气构建了一个强大的类型系统。"}]
10:["$","p","p-7",{"children":"基于之前提到的七个方面，我们来梳理下 Rust 的类型系统："}]
11:["$","ol","ol-1",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"静态类型"}],"：Rust 是静态类型语言，这意味着变量的类型在编译时就被确定。这种设计使得 Rust 在编译阶段就可以捕获许多类型错误，从而提高代码的安全性和性能。"]}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-0",{"data-language":"RUST","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-rust","children":[["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"fn"}]," ",["$","span","span-1",{"className":"hljs-title function_","children":"main"}],"() {\n    ",["$","span","span-2",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"let"}]," ",["$","span","span-3",{"className":"hljs-variable","children":"x"}],": ",["$","span","span-4",{"className":"hljs-type","children":"i32"}]," = ",["$","span","span-5",{"className":"hljs-number","children":"10"}],"; ",["$","span","span-6",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 明确指定类型"}],"\n}\n"]}]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"强类型"}],"：Rust 是强类型语言，它严格限制不同类型之间的操作。Rust 不允许隐式类型转换（例如，不能自动将整数转换为浮点数），需要显式地使用 as 进行类型转换。这种严格性有助于避免许多常见的编程错误。"]}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-0",{"data-language":"RUST","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-rust","children":[["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"fn"}]," ",["$","span","span-1",{"className":"hljs-title function_","children":"main"}],"() {\n    ",["$","span","span-2",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"let"}]," ",["$","span","span-3",{"className":"hljs-variable","children":"x"}],": ",["$","span","span-4",{"className":"hljs-type","children":"i32"}]," = ",["$","span","span-5",{"className":"hljs-number","children":"5"}],";\n    ",["$","span","span-6",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"let"}]," ",["$","span","span-7",{"className":"hljs-variable","children":"y"}],": ",["$","span","span-8",{"className":"hljs-type","children":"f64"}]," = ",["$","span","span-9",{"className":"hljs-number","children":"10.0"}],";\n\n    ",["$","span","span-10",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 错误：不能将 i32 隐式转换为 f64"}],"\n    ",["$","span","span-11",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// let sum = x + y;"}],"\n\n    ",["$","span","span-12",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 正确：需要显式转换"}],"\n    ",["$","span","span-13",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"let"}]," ",["$","span","span-14",{"className":"hljs-variable","children":"sum"}]," = x ",["$","span","span-15",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"as"}]," ",["$","span","span-16",{"className":"hljs-type","children":"f64"}]," + y;\n    ",["$","span","span-17",{"className":"hljs-built_in","children":"println!"}],"(",["$","span","span-18",{"className":"hljs-string","children":"\"Sum = {}\""}],", sum);\n}\n"]}]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"显式类型和类型推断"}],"：虽然 Rust 是显式类型语言，要求在某些情况下声明变量类型，但它也具有强大的类型推断能力。编译器可以根据上下文推断出大多数变量的类型，减少了程序员的负担。例如："]}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-0",{"data-language":"RUST","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-rust","children":[["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"let"}]," ",["$","span","span-1",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"mut "}],["$","span","span-2",{"className":"hljs-variable","children":"v"}]," = ",["$","span","span-3",{"className":"hljs-built_in","children":"vec!"}],"[];\nv.",["$","span","span-4",{"className":"hljs-title function_ invoke__","children":"push"}],"(",["$","span","span-5",{"className":"hljs-number","children":"5u8"}],");  ",["$","span","span-6",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 结合这里，Rust 编译器可以推断出 v 的类型是 Vec<u8>"}],"\n"]}]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"子类型和多态"}],"：Rust 支持泛型和 trait，这是一种多态性的实现方式。trait 类似于接口，允许定义类型可以实现的一组方法。泛型允许定义函数、结构体和枚举时使用占位类型，从而实现代码的重用和灵活性。"]}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-0",{"data-language":"RUST","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-rust","children":[["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 这里 std::fmt::Display 就是一个 trait，目前，你可以先简单理解为 trait 就是接口"}],"\n",["$","span","span-1",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"fn"}]," ",["$","span","span-2",{"className":"hljs-title function_","children":"print_value"}],"<T: std::fmt::Display>(value: T) {\n    ",["$","span","span-3",{"className":"hljs-built_in","children":"println!"}],"(",["$","span","span-4",{"className":"hljs-string","children":"\"{}\""}],", value);\n}\n\n","$L1e"," ","$L1f","() {\n    ","$L20","(","$L21",");  ","$L22","\n    ","$L23","(","$L24","); ","$L25","\n}\n"]}]}],"\n"]}],"\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n"]}]
12:["$","p","p-8",{"children":"除此之外，Rust 的类型系统还提供了其他非常强大且有用的特效，如所有权和借用、生命周期以及模式匹配。"}]
13:["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"所有权和借用（Ownership and Borrowing）"}],"："]}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"Rust 的类型系统与其所有权模型紧密结合。所有权模型通过所有权、借用和生命周期的概念来管理内存，从而在无垃圾回收器的情况下确保内存安全。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-0",{"data-language":"RUST","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-rust","children":[["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"fn"}]," ",["$","span","span-1",{"className":"hljs-title function_","children":"main"}],"() {\n    ",["$","span","span-2",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"let"}]," ",["$","span","span-3",{"className":"hljs-variable","children":"s"}]," = ",["$","span","span-4",{"className":"hljs-type","children":"String"}],"::",["$","span","span-5",{"className":"hljs-title function_ invoke__","children":"from"}],"(",["$","span","span-6",{"className":"hljs-string","children":"\"Hello\""}],");\n    ",["$","span","span-7",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"let"}]," ",["$","span","span-8",{"className":"hljs-variable","children":"len"}]," = ",["$","span","span-9",{"className":"hljs-title function_ invoke__","children":"calculate_length"}],"(&s); ",["$","span","span-10",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 借用"}],"\n    ",["$","span","span-11",{"className":"hljs-built_in","children":"println!"}],"(",["$","span","span-12",{"className":"hljs-string","children":"\"The length of '{}' is {}.\""}],", s, len);\n}\n\n",["$","span","span-13",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"fn"}]," ",["$","span","span-14",{"className":"hljs-title function_","children":"calculate_length"}],"(s: &",["$","span","span-15",{"className":"hljs-type","children":"String"}],") ",["$","span","span-16",{"className":"hljs-punctuation","children":"->"}]," ",["$","span","span-17",{"className":"hljs-type","children":"usize"}]," {\n    s.",["$","span","span-18",{"className":"hljs-title function_ invo